 "prose": [
  "Good morning. I set out at 11:08 pm and was done by 11:17 pm, 9 minutes in all, and walked 6 metres about the house.",
  "Something on the floor caught my eye three times, and each time I went to see.",
  "At one of those places there proved to be nothing at all, and I beg your pardon for the fuss.",
  "A toy I put in the bin.",
  "A cup I could find no way to take hold of; it is where it was.",
  "The cup I went to at 11:14 pm gave me the most trouble: two minutes of it.",
  "The night cost the battery 20 per cent of its charge; 80 per cent remains.",
  "A picture of each is below, with the hour and the place.",
  "I remain, as ever, your servant."
